Plus8Soft Front Office — Enterprise Edition (separately distributed)

The Enterprise Edition of Plus8Soft Front Office is NOT included in this
distribution. It is distributed separately under the Plus8Soft Commercial
License to subscription customers.

The Enterprise Edition includes additional proprietary modules including
but not limited to:

  - Multi-tenant / multi-branch deployment with strict data isolation
  - Active Directory / LDAP / SSO (SAML, OIDC) integration
  - Advanced role-based access control (RBAC) and attribute-based access
    control (ABAC), including segregation-of-duties policies
  - 7-year regulator-grade immutable audit logging
  - E-signature integrations: DocuSign, Adobe Sign, native PKI / qualified
    e-signature support (eIDAS-compliant)
  - Production-grade AI-assisted video identification (KYC) module
  - Sanctions screening: OFAC SDN, EU consolidated, UN, UK HMT
  - Premium core-banking connectors: Temenos T24, Finastra (Fusion / Phoenix /
    Equation), Finacle, FIS Profile / Horizon, Fiserv DNA / Premier, Mambu,
    Oracle FLEXCUBE
  - SWIFT MT / MX, ISO 20022 message integration
  - Card-management-system integrations (Way4, TranzWare, OpenWay, Compass
    Plus TranzAxis)
  - Multi-jurisdictional regulatory packs (EU PSD2, EU 6AMLD, US BSA, UK MLR,
    GCC AML, CIS jurisdictions)
  - Advanced workflow engine with BPMN-style process design
  - High-availability clustering and disaster recovery
  - Mobile companion application for managers
  - Cross-platform PDF generation (replaces the disabled MsReportService)
  - Power BI / Tableau / Qlik / Looker connectors
  - Native integration with Plus8Soft AML (real-time transaction screening
    of operations entered through the front office)
  - Native integration with Plus8Soft RAG (in-app knowledge assistance for
    staff: policy lookup, KYC procedure guidance, compliance Q&A)
  - Long-term support (LTS) branches with security backports
  - Air-gapped deployment

The combination of Plus8Soft Front Office Enterprise + Plus8Soft AML
Enterprise + Plus8Soft RAG Enterprise is offered as the
"Plus8Soft BankOps Suite."

For information about the Enterprise Edition or BankOps Suite, contact:
    sales@plus8soft.com

