Important regulatory and security notice

This software handles personally identifiable information (PII), customer
financial data, and biometric data (where webcam / video identification is
used). The operator is responsible for compliance with applicable laws and
regulations in their jurisdiction(s), including but not limited to:

  - General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and biometric-data
    classifications under Article 9 GDPR
  - California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) and related US state laws
  - Bank Secrecy Act (BSA) and related US regulations
  - 6th EU Anti-Money Laundering Directive (6AMLD)
  - EU Payment Services Directive 2 (PSD2) Strong Customer Authentication
  - UK Money Laundering Regulations (MLR)
  - Banking secrecy laws applicable in the operator's jurisdiction
  - Cybersecurity regulations applicable to financial institutions
    (e.g., NIS2, NYDFS Part 500, EBA Guidelines on ICT Risk)

The Community Edition is provided "AS IS" without any warranty of regulatory
compliance, security hardening, or fitness for production financial-services
use. Demo credentials and demo seed data are NOT suitable for production.

